WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Shebella moo moya o matla, o omileng o tswang teng.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Lema o tshela moya, ka lehlakoreng leo o tswang ho lona.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Etsa mola o molelele o se nang dikgeo. Moya o potlaka ha o feta sekgeong.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Dumella moya o mong ho feta hara difate. Ka mora lerako le tiileng moya o a dikoloha.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Beha difate tse telele lehlakoreng la moya, tse mahareng bohareng, le dihlahla tse kgutshwane ka pele.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Siya sebaka pakeng tsa difate le dijalo hore kganya e fihle dibetheng.
